# "Until your next end step, you may play those cards" (CR 500.4, 611.2): Seek the Beast is an instant, cast in Bot2's turn 2 (its end
# step) with Mox Ruby and Mox Emerald. It exiles the Mountain and the Llanowar Elves; Bot1's next end step is turn 3's, so in turn 3
# Bot1 plays the Mountain from exile as its land drop, and then the permission ends as that end step begins: in turn 5 the Elves in
# exile cannot be cast (! Bot1.Exile.Llanowar Elves.Cast, with the Forest's mana available - the positive control is Seek the Beast's
# own Druid, cast from exile at the same time), and stay there.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Questing Druid
Island
Island
Island
Mountain
Llanowar Elves
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

